      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- High Availability (Eventual Consistency) is acceptable\n- Low Latency (<10ms) so that requests arent delayed by our middleware rate limiter\n- High Scalability for our 1M requests per second",
